OL,3,AUK support for Falkland Islands is
OL,4,A'unwavering', Number 10 says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's position on the Falkland
OL,7,FIslands is "unwavering", Downing Street
OL,8,Fhas said after Argentina's president
OL,9,Fsaid the islands were "historically and
OL,10,Flegally" Argentinian.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham "fully supports the wishes
OL,13,Fof the islanders to remain a British
OL,14,Foverseas territory", a Downing Street
OL,15,Fspokesperson said.
OL,17,FJavier Milei said the "winds of change"
OL,18,Ffavoured his country's claim to the
OL,19,Fislands and pledged sanctions on firms
OL,20,Fplanning to exploit oil close to the
OL,21,Fterritory.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
